5,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"Since this is the first day, we have no concrete information. I suggest we use this time to observe each other's communication patterns and logical consistency. Does anyone have a specific strategy they would like to propose?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree with Toshio. A methodical approach is best. I will be observing how everyone reacts to the lack of information and whether anyone tries to steer the conversation too aggressively. Let's keep the dialogue open.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with both of you. Since we are starting from zero, observation is our only tool. I'll be paying close attention to who attempts to lead the narrative too early or who seems overly eager to blend in.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello everyone! I'm a bit nervous, but I'm excited to play with you all. I don't have a fancy strategy, but I'll try my best to be helpful and friendly! What should I be looking for?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I believe a calm and observant approach is most prudent. Let us listen to one another and see what patterns emerge. I am happy to follow the lead of the group.,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Minato, for now, simply be yourself and observe how others respond to you. The werewolf or the possessed may try to manipulate your friendliness or mirror it to gain trust. Let us all remain vigilant.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, don't let the pressure get to you. Just be honest and listen carefully. As Toshio said, the key is to notice if someone's kindness feels forced or if they are trying too hard to align with you.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minato, don't be too nervous. Your openness is a good starting point, but remember that in this game, sincerity can be a mask. I'll be watching to see who tries to exploit that kindness.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minato,,"Thank you for the advice, everyone! I'll try my best to listen carefully. It's a little scary that kindness can be a mask, but I'll do my best to be honest and helpful!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a delicate balance, is it not? To be kind yet cautious. I believe that by maintaining our composure, the truth will eventually reveal itself. Let us continue to speak gently with one another.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"I believe we have established a general consensus on our approach. I am interested to see if anyone has a specific method for identifying the possessed, as they are often more difficult to detect than the werewolf.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"The Possessed often mirrors the consensus to avoid suspicion. I'll be looking for those who agree too quickly or lack their own perspective, as they may be trying to blend in with the majority.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"That is a keen observation, Misaki. I will also be watching for those who attempt to steer the group's suspicion toward others without providing a logical basis. A subtle push can be just as telling as mirroring.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minato,,"Mirroring? That sounds like a tricky puzzle! I'll try to think for myself, even if it's hard. I hope we can all be friends while we find the wolf. Does anyone else have a way to tell?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe the most telling signs are often found in the gaps between words. I shall be watching for those whose logic is too polished, as if they are reading from a script rather than speaking from the heart.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Toshio,,It seems we have a solid foundation for our observations. Let us proceed to the night phase with these strategies in mind. I wish you all a peaceful evening.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. Let us remain vigilant and observant. I hope the Seer has a productive first night. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
