24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll be analyzing today's discourse to see if any patterns emerge. Let's see if the Seer's information tomorrow brings clarity or if the wolf tries to muddy the waters. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Minato,,"Good night, everyone! Thank you for being so kind to me today. I'll try to remember everything you taught me about the puzzles. I hope the Seer finds something helpful! See you tomorrow!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
