28,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I wish you all a restful night. May the Seer's vision be clear and our community remain safe. I look forward to our discussion tomorrow.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
